Article 2 (Commissioning of Committee Members)
The term "institutions prescribed by Ordinance of the Ministry of SMEs and Startups" in Article 4 (2) of the Enforcement Decree of the Special Act on Support for Human Resources of Small and Medium Enterprises (hereinafter referred to as the "Decree") means the following institutions: [Amended on June 2, 2006; March 23, 2013; and July 26, 2017.]
1. Special Metropolitan City, Metropolitan Cities, and Provinces;
2. Offices of education under Article 36 (1) of the Local Education Autonomy Act;
3. Universities under Article 2, subparagraphs 1 through 4 and 6, of the Higher Education Act;
4. Employment security agencies under Article 4, subparagraph 1, of the Employment Security Act;
5. The Korea Federation of Small and Medium Enterprises and its branches under Article 3 (1) 4 of the Small and Medium Enterprise Cooperatives Act;
6. National and public research institutions;
7. Other institutions for human resources development recognized by the head of a Regional Office of SMEs and Startups as contributing to human resources support for small and medium enterprises.
